{
  "title": "Wearable: BLE board on a LiPo cell",
  "description": "The core of a BLE wearable: a main board with the Raytac MDBT50Q-1MV2 (nRF52840), a 3.0 V LDO, an MCP73831 charger from USB-C and SWD pads, on a 200 mAh LP402030 cell (a project-researched part) by its own leads. PCB by tscircuit, Zephyr board files, and an enclosure folder for the case.",
